      "suggestedVersionCode": "2003",
      "description": "SBSkip is a SponsorBlock-powered media cleaner for Android.\n\nSelect a local video or audio file, provide the corresponding YouTube URL,\nand SBSkip will retrieve SponsorBlock segments and create a cleaned copy\nwith sponsor segments removed.\n\nFeatures:\n\n* SponsorBlock integration\n* Local video and audio file processing\n* Background processing with WorkManager\n* Material 3 user interface\n* Persistent settings with DataStore\n* FFmpeg-based media trimming\n* No account required\n\nSBSkip processes media locally on the device. No YouTube account or API key\nis required.\n",
      "issueTracker": "https://github.com/nihaltp/SBSkip/issues",
      "license": "GPL-3.0-only",
      "sourceCode": "https://github.com/nihaltp/SBSkip",
